Licensing of @midscene/benchmark-grounding

This file contains the complete MIT and Apache-2.0 license texts for the
dataset, along with attribution and license links for third-party materials.
For imported records, it identifies each direct source dataset, the release
used, and the license declared by its publisher.

Scope of source attribution and disclaimer
------------------------------------------
Midscene follows the license terms applicable to the dataset releases from
which it directly imports records. The testcase source fields identify those
releases. This file also retains applicable license and copyright notices
for material included in those releases. To the extent permitted by applicable
law and license terms, Midscene makes no representations or warranties about
third-party rights in that material.


