Modifications in this distribution
---------------------------------
Midscene selected source records, converted their annotations to the local
testcase format, and supplied bilingual instructions and category explanations.
Each imported testcase's index.json records its direct source dataset, record
ID and source URL. The reference.patch field describes changes to imported
records. Midscene-authored testcases have a null reference.patch.
Midscene removed embedded device and timestamp metadata where present while
preserving decoded pixels and color rendering. For each Apache-2.0 screenshot
modified by Midscene, see the file-specific notice in the reference.patch field
of the accompanying index.json.

Third-party materials depicted in screenshots
---------------------------------------------
Depicted interfaces, logos, product names, trademarks and other third-party
content remain subject to their owners' rights. This package supplies no
additional permission or endorsement on their behalf.
WEB-v1-013 (Reddit), WEB-v1-031 (Yahoo Finance), WEB-v1-037 (JD.com) and
WEB-v1-046 (Weibo) preserve copyright notices visible in the page footers.

