WEB-v1-036 (Midscene task using OpenStreetMap data)
--------------------------------------------------
Midscene authored the bilingual task and ground-truth annotation.
Midscene rendered the map of Duffy Square and the surrounding blocks in
Midtown Manhattan from data © OpenStreetMap contributors under the Open
Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0. The machine-readable map
geometry, labels, and hotel locations are available under ODbL 1.0 in
testcases/WEB-v1-036/map-source.json. The Duffy Square marker uses its
OpenStreetMap point. Hotel photos are generated illustrations. Rates,
booking availability, cancellation terms, ratings, reviews, descriptions,
and amenities are simulated.
https://www.openstreetmap.org/#map=18/40.75748/-73.986045
https://www.openstreetmap.org/node/13763522256
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

