Additional Midscene testcases using OpenStreetMap data
------------------------------------------------------
Midscene authored the interfaces, bilingual tasks, and ground-truth
annotations for the six testcases below. The basemap data is
© OpenStreetMap contributors and available under ODbL 1.0. Each testcase
includes a map-source.json with the machine-readable geometry and labels
used to render its map. The route-planning scenarios, travel estimates,
user location, and parking booking controls are benchmark examples.
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

