simulated user location. The task asks for the nearest Line 1 station.
https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/123784
https://www.openstreetmap.org/relation/123792
MOBILE-v1-082 shows streets near Rua da Madalena, Lisbon.
https://www.openstreetmap.org/#map=17/38.71305/-9.1368
