https://www.openstreetmap.org/#map=15/48.84190/2.38900
WEB-v1-070 shows fuel stations and nearby points of interest in San Francisco's
Mission District. Station photos are generated illustrations. Ratings,
descriptions and amenities in the results list are simulated.
